season_s2_side_duel__info:
Faction Duel is the ultimate battle between two factions, and the outcome directly affects the faction rankings!
During the Faction Duel, warzones of the same faction are teammates, allowing reinforcements to the Capitols and Cannons controlled by the same faction alliance;
The base color of the commanders of the same faction is displayed as light blue on the map, and the base color of the commanders of the opposing faction is displayed as light red on the map;
There are no attack restrictions between the bases of the commanders of the same faction;
At the end of the battle, in addition to the victory rewards, a large number of [Faction Rare Soil Points] will be added according to the number of Capitols and Cannons controlled by the faction.

season_s3_side_duel__info:
Faction Duel is the ultimate battle between two factions, and the outcome directly affects the faction rankings! 
During the Faction Duel, warzones of the same faction are teammates, allowing reinforcements to the Capitols and Cannons controlled by the same faction alliance; 
The base color of the commanders of the same faction is displayed as light blue on the map, and the base color of the commanders of the opposing faction is displayed as light red on the map; 
There are no attack restrictions between the bases of the commanders of the same faction; 
At the end of the battle, in addition to the victory rewards, a large number of [Faction Goldust Points] will be added according to the number of Capitols and Cannons controlled by the faction.
In this Faction Duel, 4 additional [Missile Factory] buildings have been opened in the Capitol's Contaminated Land area!
The [Missile Factory] belongs to the alliance, and you can seize the [Missile Factory] controlled by the enemy faction's alliance, or compete with the same faction's alliance for the [Missile Factory];
When the alliance captures the [Missile Factory] for a period of time, the alliance will get a [Duel Missile];
The [Duel Missile] is released by the alliance's Warlord, and can only be coordinated in the Contaminated Land area of the warzone where the Faction Duel is located;
Successfully releasing the [Duel Missile] will destroy 5,000 durability of all commander bases within range.

